# The portal Worker proxies opensource.unisim.co.uk/jukebox/* to this Worker
# with the /jukebox prefix intact, while the build output is flat. All 200s —
# transparent rewrites, not redirects.
#
# ⚠️ NO catch-all `/jukebox/* /index.html 200` rule — Workers static assets
# rejects it as an infinite loop (the asset layer strips `.html` itself, the
# same trap as the marketing site's /netzero). Unmatched paths fall through to
# `not_found_handling: single-page-application`, which serves index.html anyway.
/jukebox/sw.js                /sw.js                200
/jukebox/registerSW.js        /registerSW.js        200
/jukebox/manifest.webmanifest /manifest.webmanifest 200
/jukebox/workbox-*            /workbox-:splat       200
/jukebox/assets/*             /assets/:splat        200
/jukebox/favicon.svg          /favicon.svg          200
/jukebox/unisim-icon.png      /unisim-icon.png      200
/jukebox/icon-180.png         /icon-180.png         200
/jukebox/icon-192.png         /icon-192.png         200
/jukebox/icon-512.png         /icon-512.png         200
/jukebox/robots.txt           /robots.txt           200
/jukebox/sitemap.xml          /sitemap.xml          200
